#: source/concepts/sensors/frame_transformer.rst:7
msgid "Frame Transformer"
msgstr "坐标变换器"

#: source/concepts/sensors/frame_transformer.rst:9
msgid ""
"A :class:`~sensors.FrameTransformer` tracks the pose of one or more target "
"frames relative to a source frame. It provides the same batched interface "
"across cloned environments, avoiding repeated USD traversal or per-"
"environment transform calculations."
msgstr ""
":class:`~sensors.FrameTransformer` "
"跟踪一个或多个目标坐标系相对于源坐标系的位姿。它为克隆环境提供统一的批量接口，避免重复遍历 USD 或逐环境计算坐标变换。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/frame_transformer.rst:13
msgid "Source and target frames used by a frame transformer"
msgstr "坐标系变换器使用的源坐标系和目标坐标系"

#: source/concepts/sensors/frame_transformer.rst:19
msgid "Define frames"
msgstr "定义坐标系"

#: source/concepts/sensors/frame_transformer.rst:21
msgid ""
"The sensor's :attr:`~sensors.FrameTransformerCfg.prim_path` selects the "
"source rigid body. Each :class:`~sensors.FrameTransformerCfg.FrameCfg` "
"selects one or more target rigid bodies and can add a fixed pose offset. "
"Target paths accept regular expressions; the data order is recorded in "
":attr:`~sensors.FrameTransformerData.target_frame_names`."
msgstr ""
"传感器的 :attr:`~sensors.FrameTransformerCfg.prim_path` 选择源刚体。每个 "
":class:`~sensors.FrameTransformerCfg.FrameCfg` "
"选择一个或多个目标刚体，还可以添加固定的位姿偏移。目标路径接受正则表达式；数据顺序记录在 "
":attr:`~sensors.FrameTransformerData.target_frame_names` 中。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/frame_transformer.rst:41
msgid ""
"A target expression is inclusive. If it also matches the source body, the "
"output includes the identity transform from the source to itself. Use a "
"narrower expression when that entry is not wanted."
msgstr "目标表达式会包含所有匹配项。如果它也匹配源刚体，输出就会包含源坐标系到自身的恒等变换。如果不需要该条目，请缩小表达式的匹配范围。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/frame_transformer.rst:46
msgid "Read transforms"
msgstr "读取变换"

#: source/concepts/sensors/frame_transformer.rst:48
msgid ""
"For ``E`` environments and ``T`` resolved target frames, positions have "
"shape ``(E, T, 3)``, quaternions have shape ``(E, T, 4)``, and combined "
"poses have shape ``(E, T, 7)``. Quaternions use ``(x, y, z, w)`` order."
msgstr ""
"对于 ``E`` 个环境和解析得到的 ``T`` 个目标坐标系，位置形状为 ``(E, T, 3)`` ，四元数为 ``(E, T, 4)`` "
"，组合位姿为 ``(E, T, 7)`` 。四元数采用 ``(x, y, z, w)`` 顺序。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/frame_transformer.rst:60
msgid ""
"``target_*_source`` fields express targets in the configured source frame. "
"``target_*_w`` fields express the offset target frames in the world frame. "
"The corresponding ``source_*_w`` fields expose the offset source frame in "
"world coordinates. Positions are in meters; quaternions are unitless."
msgstr ""
"``target_*_source`` 字段在配置的源坐标系中表示目标。 ``target_*_w`` "
"字段在世界坐标系中表示施加偏移后的目标坐标系。对应的 ``source_*_w`` "
"字段给出施加偏移后的源坐标系在世界坐标系中的状态。位置单位为米，四元数无单位。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/frame_transformer.rst:64
msgid "Frame transformer debug visualization"
msgstr "坐标系变换器调试可视化"

